<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link href="/css/cssdir/out.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" integrity="sha384-iw3OoTErCYJJB9mCa8LNS2hbsQ7M3C0EpIsO/H5+EGAkPGc6rk+V8i04oW/K5xq0" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <title>Arquitetura & Engenharia — Manager Bot</title>
</head>

<body class="bg-[#090a0f] text-slate-200 min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans selection:bg-indigo-500 selection:text-white antialiased overflow-x-hidden">
    
    <!-- Background Decorators -->
    <div class="fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none bg-[#090a0f] bg-blueprint"></div>
    <div class="fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-40">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[1000px] h-[350px] bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,_rgba(88,101,242,0.12),_transparent_70%)]"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Navigation -->
    <header class="fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-50 bg-[#090a0f]/80 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-white/[0.08] transition-all duration-300">
        <nav class="container mx-auto flex items-center justify-between p-4 lg:px-8" aria-label="Global">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3 group">
                    <div class="relative w-9 h-9 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 shadow-sm group-hover:border-indigo-500/50 transition-colors">
                        <img class="w-full h-full object-cover" src="/res/serverIcon/boticon.jpg" alt="Bot Icon">
                    </div>
                    <span class="font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight text-white group-hover:text-slate-200 transition-colors">Manager Bot</span>
                </a>
            </div>
            
            <div class="hidden lg:flex items-center lg:gap-x-1 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.08] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full">
                <a href="/auth/docs" class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/[0.05] transition-all duration-150">Documentação</a>
                <a href="/auth/funcutils" class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/[0.05] transition-all duration-150">Módulos & Funções</a>
                <a href="/auth/about" class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-white bg-white/[0.08] transition-all duration-150">Arquitetura</a>
                <a href="/auth/devs" class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/[0.05] transition-all duration-150">Comunidade</a>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <a href="/auth/discord" class="btn-studio-primary text-xs sm:text-sm !py-2 sm:!py-2.5 !px-4 sm:!px-5 rounded-xl">
                    <i class="fa-brands fa-discord text-base"></i>
                    <span>Acessar Painel</span>
                </a>
                <button type="button" onclick="toggleNavMenu()" class="lg:hidden p-2 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-slate-300 hover:text-white" aria-label="Menu">
                    <i id="nav-toggle-icon" class="fa-solid fa-bars text-lg"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
        </nav>
        <div id="mobile-nav-dropdown" class="hidden lg:hidden border-t border-white/5 bg-[#090a0f]/95 backdrop-blur-2xl px-6 py-5 space-y-2">
            <a href="/auth/docs" class="block py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-all">Documentação</a>
            <a href="/auth/funcutils" class="block py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-all">Módulos & Funções</a>
            <a href="/auth/about" class="block py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-white bg-white/[0.08] transition-all">Arquitetura</a>
            <a href="/auth/devs" class="block py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-all">Comunidade</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <main class="relative z-10 flex-grow pt-28 sm:pt-36 pb-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto w-full">
        <div class="mb-12 border-b border-white/[0.08] pb-8">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.08] text-slate-300 text-xs font-mono mb-4">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip text-indigo-400"></i>
                <span>Especificação de Engenharia • v1.5.0</span>
            </div>
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-3">
                Arquitetura do Sistema & Segurança
            </h1>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-400 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
                Entenda como o Manager Bot processa webhooks, isola dados de guildas e mantém alta performance com consultas indexadas.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Diagrama Técnico de Arquitetura do Sistema -->
        <div class="panel-chassis laser-edge-top p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl mb-10 relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6 border-b border-white/[0.06] pb-4">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-diagram-project text-base"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Fluxo de Dados & Barramento de Eventos</h2>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">DISCORD GATEWAY ⇄ ASYNC PIPELINE ⇄ STUDIO DASHBOARD</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 self-start sm:self-auto">
                    <span class="badge-metallic-cyan flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-[11px]">
                        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-pulse"></span>
                        PIPELINE ACTIVE
                    </span>
                    <span class="badge-metallic-emerald font-mono text-[11px]">99.98% UPTIME</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Pipeline Flow Grid -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 relative">
                
                <!-- Stage 1: Discord Gateway -->
                <div class="relative p-4 rounded-xl bg-black/40 border border-white/[0.08] flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-cyan-500/40 transition-all">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-cyan-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">01 // INGRESS</span>
                            <i class="fa-brands fa-discord text-cyan-400 text-sm"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">Discord Gateway</h4>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-3">
                            Conexão WebSocket contínua recebendo payloads brutos de guildas e interações em tempo real.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pt-3 border-t border-white/[0.06] flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[10px] text-slate-400">
                        <span>WS Protocol</span>
                        <span class="text-cyan-400 font-semibold">~15ms</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Stage 2: Node.js Controller -->
                <div class="relative p-4 rounded-xl bg-black/40 border border-white/[0.08] flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-indigo-500/40 transition-all">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-indigo-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">02 // PROCESSING</span>
                            <i class="fa-brands fa-node-js text-emerald-400 text-sm"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">Event Loop Cluster</h4>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-3">
                            Filtros assíncronos, roteamento Express, validação de tokens e despacho não bloqueante.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pt-3 border-t border-white/[0.06] flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[10px] text-slate-400">
                        <span>Async Queue</span>
                        <span class="text-indigo-400 font-semibold">O(1) Dispatch</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Stage 3: MongoDB Indexes -->
                <div class="relative p-4 rounded-xl bg-black/40 border border-white/[0.08] flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-all">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">03 // PERSISTENCE</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-database text-emerald-400 text-sm"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">MongoDB Replica</h4>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-3">
                            Consultas atômicas com índices compostos, cache in-memory e isolamento rigoroso por guilda.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pt-3 border-t border-white/[0.06] flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[10px] text-slate-400">
                        <span>Compound Keys</span>
                        <span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">&lt; 2ms Query</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Stage 4: Studio Dashboard UI -->
                <div class="relative p-4 rounded-xl bg-black/40 border border-white/[0.08] flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-all">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-amber-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">04 // TELEMETRY</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-sliders text-amber-400 text-sm"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">Studio Cockpit</h4>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-3">
                            Painel de controle com hardware switches, simulador de embeds ao vivo e feedback assíncrono.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pt-3 border-t border-white/[0.06] flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[10px] text-slate-400">
                        <span>SPA / PostMessage</span>
                        <span class="text-amber-400 font-semibold">Zero Reload</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            
            <!-- Stack Tecnológica -->
            <div class="panel-elevated rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400 mb-4">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-cubes text-base"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Stack de Tecnologia</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    Desenvolvido sobre uma base moderna em Node.js com arquitetura orientada a serviços e eventos assíncronos:
                </p>
                <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-300">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-400 text-[10px]"></i> <strong>Discord.js v14:</strong> Gateway Intents, Slash Commands e Sharding preparado.</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-400 text-[10px]"></i> <strong>Express.js & EJS:</strong> Servidor HTTP leve com renderização server-side ultra-rápida.</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-400 text-[10px]"></i> <strong>Tailwind CSS v4:</strong> Compilação sob demanda em &lt; 150ms com tokens customizados.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Banco de Dados & Índices -->
            <div class="panel-elevated rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 mb-4">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-database text-base"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Persistência & Índices MongoDB</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    Todas as consultas periódicas de verificação utilizam chaves compostas para garantir tempo de busca constante O(1):
                </p>
                <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-300 font-mono">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-300"><span class="text-indigo-400 font-bold">•</span> UserSchema: { idguild: 1, codigouser: 1 }</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-300"><span class="text-indigo-400 font-bold">•</span> VideoSchema: { notifyGuild: 1, youtube: 1 }</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-300"><span class="text-indigo-400 font-bold">•</span> TwitchSchema: { guildID: 1, twitch: 1 }</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Otimização de APIs de Terceiros -->
            <div class="panel-elevated rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-red-400 mb-4">
                    <i class="fa-brands fa-youtube text-base"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Otimização de Cotas (YouTube v3)</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Em vez de realizar buscas textuais de alto custo (100 unidades por busca), o motor resolve canais diretamente por ID ou @handle consumindo apenas 1 cota da API v3 do Google, garantindo 100x mais escalabilidade com resiliência via AbortSignal.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Segurança & OAuth2 -->
            <div class="panel-elevated rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 mb-4">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-base"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Segurança & Autenticação</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Sessões protegidas via Discord OAuth2 oficial com validação de escopos da guilda. Apenas membros com cargos administrativos ou permissão explícita de Gerenciar Servidor podem acionar rotas e alterar canais de destino.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="border-t border-white/[0.06] py-8 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
        <p>Manager Bot © 2026 • Arquitetura & Engenharia de Dados</p>
    </footer>

    <script>
        function toggleNavMenu() {
            const menu = document.getElementById("mobile-nav-dropdown");
            const icon = document.getElementById("nav-toggle-icon");
            if (!menu || !icon) return;
            const isHidden = menu.classList.contains("hidden");
            if (isHidden) {
                menu.classList.remove("hidden");
                icon.classList.remove("fa-bars");
                icon.classList.add("fa-xmark");
            } else {
                menu.classList.add("hidden");
                icon.classList.remove("fa-xmark");
                icon.classList.add("fa-bars");
            }
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>